  "question": {
    "text": "Let a line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;be a tangent to the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is also a tangent to the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to:",
    "image": null
  },
