  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a tangent to the hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given that,&nbsp;tangent to hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Thus, we have, slope <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Thus, the equation of the tangent to the hyperbola is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given this line is also a tangent to the parabola,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and a line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is tangent to the parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
